  "system": {
    "container": null,
    "props": {
      "description": "<ul><li><p>Your  <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> escape DL is <strong>13</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You can apply <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> to any character that <strong>Grapple</strong> you.</p></li></ul>",
      "isMartial": false,
      "isSet": true,
      "item_baseDef": "0",
      "item_baseMdef": "0",
      "item_cost": "0",
      "item_def_bonus": "2",
      "item_type": "armor",
      "name": "Luchador Pant",
      "set_description": "<p><strong>【Set Bonus】</strong></p><p><strong>2-Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>You can <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> maximum 3 creature</p></li><li><p>You can't use <strong>【Objective】</strong> and <strong>【Equipment】</strong> action if you <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> 2 or more creature.</p></li><li><p>You can't use <strong>【Inventory】</strong> and <strong>【Attack】</strong> action if you <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> 3 creature</p><hr contenteditable=\"false\"></li></ul><p><strong>3-Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>You may perform the skill 【💥<strong>Powerbomb</strong>】</p></li></ul><hr class=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\"><details><summary><strong>💥 Powerbomb</strong></summary><p><strong>Cost:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Target:</strong> Grappled Creatures</p><p><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</p><p>Remove <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-id=\"FV8JefaHsehzgXR7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Grappled</a> from all creature Grappled by you, then deal 50 <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-id=\"XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-type=\"Item\">Physical</a> damage to them</p><p></p></details>",
